#: ../fhir-harness/processes/content/ig-release.bpmn:95
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "`bun run fhir-harness/scripts/ig-release.ts check --ig . --repo <owner/repo>` (Tool `ig-release`). Prints one notice per finding: `version X is untagged: the owner tags commit <sha> with vX`, or `tag vX has no release: run \"IG release (draft)\" (ig-release.yml) by hand with tag vX`, or that a draft waits for the owner. Exits 0 always; never tags and never releases."
msgstr ""

#: ../fhir-harness/processes/content/ig-release.bpmn:67
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "`ig-release.yml` (Tool `ig-release`): `ig-ast-refresh.yml` with `force` and `release` (never incremental), then `ig-release.ts assets` gathers `package.tgz` (and `package.r4.tgz`, `package.r4b.tgz`), `ast-data.zip` (the AST, Libraries with their ELM) and `SHA256SUMS`, and `ig-release.ts draft` makes or refreshes the GitHub draft for the tag. A tag with a published release is refused."
msgstr ""

